   "grammar": [
    {
     "ref": "b_past"
    },
    {
     "title": "过去发生、已经结束",
     "points": [
      "be 的过去式：I / he / she / it → was；you / we / they → were。",
      "规则动词加 -ed：work → worked；以 e 结尾加 -d：live → lived；辅音 + y → ied：study → studied；重读闭音节双写：stop → stopped。",
      "-ed 的读法：清辅音后 /t/（worked）；浊辅音和元音后 /d/（played）；t, d 后 /ɪd/（wanted, needed）。",
      "时间词：yesterday, last night/week/year, ... ago, in 2020, just now。",
      "否定和疑问用 did，后面动词回到原形：I didn't go. Did you see it?"
     ],
     "examples": [
      [
       "I worked late yesterday, so I was tired.",
       "我昨天工作到很晚，所以很累。"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
   "special": [
