   "grammar": [
    {
     "title": "五个时态放在一起看",
     "points": [
      "一般现在：习惯、事实 —— I work in Osaka.",
      "现在进行：此刻正在 —— I'm working now.",
      "一般过去：过去某时，已结束 —— I worked late yesterday.",
      "现在完成：经历、持续到现在、结果影响现在 —— I've worked here for two years.",
      "将来：will / be going to —— I'll work from home tomorrow.",
      "做题先找时间标志词：every day → 一般现在；now / Look! → 进行；yesterday / ago → 过去；for / since / ever / already → 完成；tomorrow / next → 将来。"
     ],
     "examples": [
      [
       "I usually walk, but today I'm taking a taxi because I got up late.",
       "我平时走路，但今天打车，因为起晚了。"
      ]
     ]
    }
   ],
